  "Type25c_rframe: 16-bit form from PGR",
  "Type23p_undoc16: provisional, from firmware only (0x023e x329, top-7 0000001 family = 62% of unknowns)",
  "Type21p_undoc16: provisional, from firmware only (the old Type21a prefix; 95% of its matches are not the all-zero NOP word)",
  "Type22p_undoc48: provisional, from firmware only (the old Type22a prefix; its strict word occurs in neither image; 48 bits as the loose Type22a read them -- a 16-bit reading strands the other two words)",
  "Type26p_undoc48: provisional, from firmware only (the old Type26a prefix; one instance per image, too few to judge)",
  "Type8p_undoc48: provisional, from firmware only (bits 47-41 = 0000011 with bit 25 set, which no real Type 8a branch has; 32 across the two images)",
  "Type19p_undoc48: provisional, from firmware only (bits 44-40 = 10101, which no manual documents; taken from Type19a when its mask is tightened to the nine bits the classic grid fixes)"
